1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 13=

8
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:49,399
With my potent vitality,
I certainly could.

9
00:00:49,399 --> 00:00:51,500
Without the vows of marriage,

10
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:53,259
we cannot engage in marital intimacy.

11
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,280
That is my bottom line,

12
00:00:55,719 --> 00:00:56,719
and I won't cross it.

13
00:00:56,719 --> 00:00:59,140
Dong, at a time like this,

14
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:01,240
stop bothering about trivial boundaries.

15
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,039
Saving a life comes first!

16
00:01:03,119 --> 00:01:05,719
Besides, even though she was divorced,

17
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:07,319
the marriage certificate is still valid.

18
00:01:12,780 --> 00:01:14,260
I was out of line.

19
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,219
A healer's compassion

20
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:19,500
has its own principles.

21
00:01:20,079 --> 00:01:22,079
Taking advantage
of someone in crisis is shameless.

22
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:23,859
It's certainly not my way.

23
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:26,719
If this way fails,

24
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:28,359
we'll just find another.

25
00:01:32,819 --> 00:01:34,439
I'll use golden needles
on your acupoints

26
00:01:34,859 --> 00:01:37,140
to seal the meridians around your heart,

27
00:01:37,359 --> 00:01:39,299
delaying the spread of the Gu poison

28
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:41,000
and the pain of its flare-ups.

29
00:01:46,859 --> 00:01:49,400
Sir, I found
Her Majesty at the county inn.

30
00:01:49,719 --> 00:01:51,640
We must capture Her Majesty this time.

31
00:01:52,719 --> 00:01:54,180
We'll surely be rewarded handsomely.

32
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:55,799
Go then.

33
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:58,060
Understood. Let's go.

34
00:02:09,419 --> 00:02:12,159
I don't like your face.

35
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:13,879
Slap yourself.

36
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:14,960
Yes.

37
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:28,340
Why are you slapping yourself?

38
00:02:33,740 --> 00:02:34,740
Worthless scum.

39
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,800
Don't hurt her!

40
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,520
Thank you.

41
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,520
Don't thank me yet.

42
00:02:59,719 --> 00:03:00,879
That was just temporary,

43
00:03:01,159 --> 00:03:02,159
not the permanent cure.

44
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:04,819
At most, it'll buy you ten days.

45
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,280
Ten days?

46
00:03:19,479 --> 00:03:21,800
Wan'er, look after her.

47
00:03:22,419 --> 00:03:23,419
Sure, Dong.

48
00:03:33,159 --> 00:03:34,199
Interesting.

49
00:03:34,460 --> 00:03:35,919
You two seem very close.

50
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:38,180
I love testing human nature most.

51
00:03:38,919 --> 00:03:40,740
You're willing
to risk your life for her,

52
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,240
but what about her for you?

53
00:03:54,060 --> 00:03:55,060
Ergou!

54
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,840
Ergou!

55
00:03:58,759 --> 00:04:00,759
Stop it! Don't hurt him!

56
00:04:04,460 --> 00:04:05,460
You!

57
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,379
If you want to kill him, kill me first!

58
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:11,699
Don't worry about me!

59
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,900
Run now!

60
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,479
A woman of low status

61
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,399
and a foolish country bumpkin

62
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,319
are surprisingly loyal to each other.

63
00:04:20,300 --> 00:04:21,300
I don't believe that.

64
00:04:21,319 --> 00:04:22,879
How dare you hurt her!

65
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:26,279
Dong won't let you get away with this!

66
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:32,120
Ergou, run!

67
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,120
Go find Dong now!

68
00:04:33,300 --> 00:04:34,300
Don't mind me!

69
00:04:34,459 --> 00:04:37,220
If we die, we die together.

70
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:40,300
How touching.

71
00:04:40,980 --> 00:04:44,899
Too bad I despise
such hypocritical friendship most.

72
00:04:45,060 --> 00:04:47,420
Since you both want
to die for each other,

73
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:49,620
I'll start with you then.

74
00:04:54,740 --> 00:04:55,740
Ergou!

75
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:59,819
Please let him go!

76
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,120
Please!

77
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:03,959
Dong! Dong, where are you?

78
00:05:04,579 --> 00:05:05,579
Dong!

79
00:05:05,660 --> 00:05:07,024
Ergou!

80
00:05:07,024 --> 00:05:09,180
They're with me.
How dare you hurt them!

81
00:05:11,939 --> 00:05:12,939
Dong!

82
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,120
Dong!

83
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:33,259
Sir, spare my life!

84
00:05:33,500 --> 00:05:35,240
You like testing human nature, do you?

85
00:05:36,060 --> 00:05:38,720
Guess how I'll deal with you.

86
00:05:39,180 --> 00:05:40,459
I'm the Holy Maiden of Zixia Sect.

87
00:05:40,459 --> 00:05:43,120
If I die, Ancestor at the Mahayana stage
will sense it immediately.

88
00:05:43,399 --> 00:05:45,300
The Mahayana is the peak cultivation
stage in the mortal realm.

89
00:05:45,519 --> 00:05:46,519
Though you are powerful,

90
00:05:46,620 --> 00:05:47,660
still no match for him.

91
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,120
Are you threatening me?

92
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:52,100
I-I wouldn't dare!

93
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,699
(The Zixia Sect?)

94
00:05:59,879 --> 00:06:02,100
(It was founded by my former follower.)

95
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:03,959
(After ten thousand years,)

96
00:06:04,259 --> 00:06:06,019
(it has become the greatest sect
in the mortal realm.)

97
00:06:12,620 --> 00:06:13,980
Thank you for sparing my life.

98
00:06:14,939 --> 00:06:16,420
I never said I'd spare you.

99
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,720
You slapped my wife so many times,

100
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,019
so I will...

101
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,620
I deserve to be punished.

102
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:35,480
What are you doing?

103
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:38,899
I meant I'd let my wife
slap you back herself.

104
00:06:40,300 --> 00:06:41,819
I didn't say I'd do it myself.

105
00:06:42,660 --> 00:06:43,939
Forget it, Dong.

106
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:47,740
She looks pitiful enough.

107
00:06:52,439 --> 00:06:53,439
I know my wrongdoing.

108
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,040
Punish me as you please.

109
00:06:55,180 --> 00:06:56,180
I won't complain.

110
00:06:56,339 --> 00:06:57,439
You are spared from death,

111
00:06:58,259 --> 00:06:59,459
yet doomed to suffer.

112
00:06:59,980 --> 00:07:00,980
My word is law.

113
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,279
My will is decree.

114
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:04,339
Today, I strip your Golden Core

115
00:07:04,699 --> 00:07:05,899
and Foundation,

116
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:07,360
dispersing your powers

117
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,160
to make you a mortal.

118
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:14,660
She left and never came back.

119
00:07:14,939 --> 00:07:16,959
I really don't know where she went.

120
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:19,720
You wrench, stop lying!

121
00:07:20,779 --> 00:07:21,819
Confess or not?

122
00:07:22,259 --> 00:07:25,040
If not, I'll cut your throat right now.

123
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:27,519
I-I really don't know.

124
00:07:28,500 --> 00:07:31,399
(I kept my promise to Dong.)

125
00:07:31,939 --> 00:07:34,759
(Dong, let's reunite in the next life.)

126
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:38,160
Do you think I won't kill anyone?

127
00:07:38,860 --> 00:07:39,860
Kill both of them

128
00:07:40,060 --> 00:07:41,100
to show her!

129
00:07:41,259 --> 00:07:42,259
Yes!

130
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,480
Stop!

131
00:07:47,259 --> 00:07:48,259
Why are you out?

132
00:07:50,220 --> 00:07:52,540
I am here. Release them all.

133
00:07:53,319 --> 00:07:54,860
Didn't I tell you to hide?

134
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,300
Once Dong returns,

135
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:57,759
he will surely protect you.

136
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,519
He may be that capable,

137
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:03,620
but I cannot watch my people suffer.

138
00:08:04,199 --> 00:08:05,519
I am the ruler of a nation.

139
00:08:06,399 --> 00:08:09,160
How could I drag innocent people down
for my own sake?

140
00:08:09,779 --> 00:08:12,339
Surviving in hiding
is not what an empress should do.

141
00:08:13,620 --> 00:08:15,319
(I can't let Zhao Dong look down on me.)

142
00:08:15,899 --> 00:08:17,139
(I have my own pride.)

143
00:08:17,300 --> 00:08:19,399
Cut the chatter! Seize her!

144
00:08:19,399 --> 00:08:21,000
- Yes!
- Stop!

145
00:08:22,079 --> 00:08:23,079
I can walk myself.

146
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:28,379
You're just a prisoner,
stop putting on royal airs!

147
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:30,480
As for these people,

148
00:08:31,220 --> 00:08:32,320
kill them all!

149
00:08:33,139 --> 00:08:34,139
Spare no one!

150
00:08:34,139 --> 00:08:35,879
- Yes!
- Stop!

151
00:08:37,259 --> 00:08:38,440
If you lay a hand on them,

152
00:08:40,179 --> 00:08:42,679
I will accept what Lord Duan offers,

153
00:08:43,399 --> 00:08:44,899
but my only condition

154
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,159
is to have you all executed.

155
00:08:51,159 --> 00:08:53,799
Your Majesty, please go.

156
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,440
Tell him

157
00:09:00,659 --> 00:09:03,100
that I am the empress
and never accept any humiliation.

158
00:09:03,820 --> 00:09:05,700
Once I reclaim my throne,

159
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:08,240
I will punish him severely.

160
00:09:19,539 --> 00:09:20,539
(Her Majesty said that)

161
00:09:21,179 --> 00:09:23,220
(so Dong wouldn't risk his life
to save her.)

162
00:09:23,799 --> 00:09:26,700
(Her Majesty has her pride.)

163
00:09:44,575 --> 00:09:48,166
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

164
00:09:48,166 --> 00:09:50,953
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

165
00:09:51,529 --> 00:09:53,691
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

166
00:09:53,691 --> 00:09:56,537
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

167
00:09:56,537 --> 00:09:59,815
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

168
00:09:59,815 --> 00:10:01,449
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

169
00:10:01,449 --> 00:10:03,513
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

170
00:10:03,513 --> 00:10:05,049
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

171
00:10:05,049 --> 00:10:07,831
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

172
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:10,185
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

173
00:10:10,185 --> 00:10:16,216
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

174
00:10:16,798 --> 00:10:20,681
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

175
00:10:20,681 --> 00:10:23,906
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

176
00:10:24,418 --> 00:10:27,017
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

177
00:10:27,017 --> 00:10:32,145
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

178
00:10:32,145 --> 00:10:35,673
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

179
00:10:35,673 --> 00:10:39,381
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

180
00:10:39,381 --> 00:10:41,273
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

181
00:10:41,273 --> 00:10:43,350
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

182
00:10:43,350 --> 00:10:45,881
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

183
00:10:45,881 --> 00:10:49,918
♪You met the most precious person♪

184
00:10:51,586 --> 00:10:53,449
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

185
00:10:53,449 --> 00:10:55,968
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

186
00:10:55,968 --> 00:10:57,417
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

187
00:10:57,417 --> 00:10:59,719
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

188
00:10:59,719 --> 00:11:01,689
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

189
00:11:01,689 --> 00:11:06,099
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

190
00:11:06,099 --> 00:11:07,641
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

191
00:11:07,641 --> 00:11:09,551
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

192
00:11:09,551 --> 00:11:12,825
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

193
00:11:12,825 --> 00:11:16,146
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

194
00:11:16,146 --> 00:11:17,881
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

195
00:11:17,881 --> 00:11:22,505
♪Just catch your breath first♪

196
00:11:22,505 --> 00:11:26,255
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

197
00:11:26,255 --> 00:11:29,633
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

198
00:11:30,007 --> 00:11:31,977
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

199
00:11:31,977 --> 00:11:37,724
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

200
00:11:37,724 --> 00:11:41,240
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

201
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,809
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

202
00:11:42,809 --> 00:11:45,119
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

203
00:11:45,119 --> 00:11:46,857
♪From laughter to devotion♪

204
00:11:46,857 --> 00:11:48,913
♪From falling to innocence♪

205
00:11:48,913 --> 00:11:50,761
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

206
00:11:50,761 --> 00:11:57,431
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
